  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Linear System as Column Vector</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Solve the following system of linear equations for \(x\) and \(y\):</p>
\[ \begin{aligned}
{@eq1@} \\
{@eq2@}
\end{aligned} \]
<p>Enter your solution as a column vector \(\mathbf{x} = \begin{bmatrix} x \\ y \end{bmatrix}\):</p>
<p>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>The system in matrix form is \(A\mathbf{x} = \mathbf{b}\):</p>
\[ \begin{bmatrix} {@a11@} & {@a12@} \\ {@a21@} & {@a22@} \end{bmatrix} \begin{bmatrix} x \\ y \end{bmatrix} = \begin{bmatrix} {@b1@} \\ {@b2@} \end{bmatrix} \]
<p>Solving via elimination or matrix inverse gives:</p>
\[ x = {@xs@}, \quad y = {@ys@} \]
<p>In vector form:</p>
\[ \mathbf{x} = \begin{bmatrix} {@xs@} \\ {@ys@} \end{bmatrix} \]]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1000000</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber>demo-linear-system-matrix</idnumber>
    <stackversion>
      <text>2025102100</text>
    </stackversion>
    <questionvariables>
      <text><![CDATA[/* 2x2 linear system with integer solution */
xs: rand([1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]);
ys: rand([-6, -5, -4, -3, -2, -1]);

a11: rand([2, 3]);
a12: rand([1, 2]);
a21: rand([1, 2]);
a22: rand([3, 4]);

A: matrix([a11, a12], [a21, a22]);
X: matrix([xs], [ys]);
B: A . X;
b1: B[1, 1];
b2: B[2, 1];

ta1: X;
ans_swapped: matrix([ys], [xs]);

eq1: a11*x + a12*y = b1;
eq2: a21*x + a22*y = b2;
]]></text>
    </questionvariables>
